# S01: sonda da interface remota do GPSG-1000
# Objetivo: capturar a lista oficial de comandos do firmware, o estado do usuário anterior,
# resolver as discrepâncias D01 a D23 do manual e coletar golden files.
# Tempo estimado: 25 a 35 min. Partes A, B, C, D e G sem RF. Parte E com RF em carga ou receptor de referência.
# Execução: runners/gpsg-run.ps1 -Address <ip> -Script sessions/S01-sonda.scpi
# Todo arquivo criado no equipamento tem prefixo twin_. A parte F restaura o estado anterior.

@errcheck on
@mark S01 inicio

# ---------------- A: identificação e estado do usuário anterior ----------------
@mark A1 identificacao
*IDN?
:SYST:ERR?
GPS:STAT?
GPS:SIM:TRUN?
@pause Se TRUN? retornou Running, a simulacao de outro usuario esta ativa. Interrompa o script (Ctrl+C) e combine antes de parar.

@mark A2 backup
GPS:FIL:SET:FNAM?
GPS:FIL:ROUT:FNAM?
GPS:FIL:ALM:FNAM?
GPS:FIL:NMEA:FNAM?
GPS:FIL:SET:SAV "twin_bkp_s01"
GPS:FIL:ROUT:SAV "twin_bkp_s01.rte"

@mark A3 lista oficial de comandos (resolve a maior parte das discrepancias)
GPS:? ALL
GPS:SET:CHAN:AVAL?

@mark A4 snapshot de parametros
GPS:SET:UNIT?
GPS:SET:GNSS?
GPS:SET:CARR?
GPS:SET:STYP?
GPS:SET:SBAS?
GPS:SET:DNOS?
GPS:SET:FAD?
GPS:SET:PRNS?
GPS:SET:PSRC?
GPS:SET:CLOC?
GPS:SET:DAT?
GPS:SET:TIM?
GPS:SET:RFPR?
GPS:SET:RFLV?
GPS:SET:CRMM?
GPS:SET:MLAT?
GPS:SET:MLON?
GPS:SET:MVEL?
GPS:SET:CLOS?
GPS:SET:CCAB?
GPS:SET:DCAB?
GPS:SET:SLOS?
GPS:SET:EREF?
GPS:SET:RSRC?
GPS:SET:TSRC?
GPS:SET:CHAN:GNSS?
GPS:SET:CHAN:SBAS?
GPS:SET:CHAN:DUAL:GPS?
GPS:SET:CHAN:DUAL:GAL?
GPS:SET:CHAN:DUAL:SBAS?
GPS:SIM:LAT?
GPS:SIM:LONG?
GPS:SIM:ALT?
GPS:FIL:ALM:FLST?
GPS:FIL:ROUT:FLST?
GPS:FIL:SET:FLST?
GPS:FIL:NMEA:FLST?
GPS:FIL:KML:FLST?
GPS:ROUT:LIST?
GPS:WAYP:LIST?
GPS:GPSR:FIX?
GPS:GPSR:AST?
GPS:GPSR:CTIM?

# ---------------- B: sintaxe ----------------
@mark B1 D05 grafias da porta de RF
GPS:SET:RFPR?
GPS:SET:RFPORT?
GPS:SETUP:RFPORT?
GPS:SET:PORT?

@mark B2 D06 STYP e STYPE, PSRC com e sem aspas
GPS:SET:STYP?
GPS:SET:STYPE?
GPS:SET:PSRC USER
GPS:SET:PSRC "USER"

@mark B3 D04 unidades em SI e sintaxe do sufixo
GPS:SET:UNIT SI
GPS:SET:UNIT?
GPS:SIM:ALT 300
GPS:SIM:ALT?
GPS:SIM:ALT? FT
GPS:SIM:ALT? M
GPS:SIM:ALT 1000 FT
GPS:SIM:ALT?
GPS:SIM:ALT 1000FT
GPS:SIM:ALT?
GPS:SET:MVEL?
GPS:SET:MLAT?

@mark B4 D04 unidades em IMPERIAL
GPS:SET:UNIT IMPERIAL
GPS:SIM:ALT?
GPS:SET:MVEL?
GPS:SET:MLAT?
GPS:SET:UNIT SI

@mark B5 D07 formatos de latitude e longitude
GPS:SIM:LAT -12.5
GPS:SIM:LAT?
GPS:SIM:LAT 12,30.0000,S
GPS:SIM:LAT?
GPS:SIM:LONG -45.25
GPS:SIM:LONG?
GPS:SIM:LONG 045,15.0000,W
GPS:SIM:LONG?

@mark B6 D20 cabecalho SIMU
GPS:SIMU:SPD?
GPS:SIM:SPD?

@mark B7 D09 CHAN SINGLE nao documentado
GPS:SET:CHAN:SINGLE?

@mark B8 D12 D13 opcoes so de UI
GPS:SET:CLOC INTERNAL
GPS:SET:CLOC?
GPS:SET:PRNS TRAJ
GPS:SET:PRNS?
GPS:SET:PRNS FIXED

# ---------------- C: rota ----------------
@mark C1 D04 D08 rota de 3 pontos (exemplo do manual), unidades de entrada e de retorno
GPS:SET:CRMM UNLIMITED
GPS:ROUT:CLR
GPS:ROUT:ADD:POIN "twin_p1",39.2976,-94.7139,312,500,500,100,25
GPS:ROUT:ADD:POIN "twin_p2",38.4081,-96.0000,1869,500,500,100,25
GPS:ROUT:ADD:POIN "twin_p3",37.6499,-97.4331,406,500,500,100,25
GPS:ROUT:LIST?
GPS:ROUT:DISP? 1
GPS:ROUT:VALD
GPS:STAT?
GPS:ROUT:EDIT 3,"twin_p3",37.6499,-97.4331,406,500,400,100,25
GPS:ROUT:DISP? 3
GPS:ROUT:LOOP OFF
GPS:ROUT:SAV "twin_probe.rte"
GPS:ROUT:FIL?

# ---------------- D: tokens do settings XML ----------------
@mark D1 combinacao 1
GPS:SET:GNSS GALILEO
GPS:SET:CRGA E5
GPS:SET:SBAS OFF
GPS:SET:STYP DYNAMIC
GPS:SET:DNOS ON
GPS:SET:FAD AIRCRAFT
GPS:SET:PRNS VARIABLE
GPS:SET:PSRC GPS
GPS:SET:CLOC GPSRX
GPS:SET:UNIT AERO/SI
GPS:SET:RFPR DIRECT
GPS:SET:CRMM HIGH_PERFORMANCE_AIRCRAFT
GPS:SET:EREF ON
GPS:SET:TSRC EXTERNAL
GPS:FIL:SET:SAV "twin_tok_1"
@mark D2 combinacao 2
GPS:SET:GNSS GAL+GPS
GPS:SET:CRGG L5/E5
GPS:SET:STYP TRAJECTORY
GPS:SET:FAD PEDESTRIAN
GPS:SET:UNIT AERO/IMPERIAL
GPS:SET:CRMM MARINE
GPS:SET:EREF OFF
GPS:SET:TSRC AUTO
GPS:FIL:SET:SAV "twin_tok_2"
@mark D3 combinacao 3
GPS:SET:GNSS GPS
GPS:SET:CARR L2C
GPS:SET:STYP STATIC
GPS:SET:FAD VEHICLE
GPS:SET:PSRC USER
GPS:SET:CLOC USER
GPS:SET:UNIT IMPERIAL
GPS:SET:CRMM AUTOMOTIVE
GPS:SET:PRNS FIXED
GPS:SET:RFPR COUPLER
GPS:FIL:SET:SAV "twin_tok_3"
GPS:SET:UNIT SI

# ---------------- E: execução com RF ----------------
@mark E0 preparacao de RF
@pause Porta DIRECT em carga de 50 ohm, atenuador para o receptor de referencia, ou DUT em bancada. Nada irradiando. Enter para continuar.
GPS:SET:GNSS GPS
GPS:SET:CARR L1/E1
GPS:SET:SBAS OFF
GPS:SET:STYP STATIC
GPS:SET:RFPR DIRECT
GPS:SET:DNOS ON
GPS:SET:FAD NONE
GPS:SET:PRNS FIXED
GPS:SET:PSRC USER
GPS:SET:CLOC USER
GPS:SET:DAT "04/14/2013"
GPS:SET:TIM "11:11:11"
GPS:SET:TSRC AUTO
GPS:FIL:ALM:DEF
GPS:SIM:LAT 37.6499
GPS:SIM:LONG -97.4331
GPS:SIM:ALT 400
GPS:SET:RFLV -130
@run
@wait 10
GPS:SIM:TRUN?
GPS:SIM:GPS:PRN?
GPS:SIM:GPS:VSVS?
@mark E1 D03 formato de LIST
GPS:SVPR:GPS:LIST?
@input PRN Digite um PRN que aparece em GPS:SIM:GPS:PRN?
GPS:SVPR:GPS:SAT? ${PRN}

@mark E2 D02 sete parametros
GPS:SVPR:GPS:SAT ${PRN},ON,GOOD,0,0,0,0
GPS:SVPR:GPS:SAT? ${PRN}
@mark E3 D02 oito parametros
GPS:SVPR:GPS:SAT ${PRN},ON,GOOD,0,0,0,0,3600
GPS:SVPR:GPS:SAT? ${PRN}

@mark E4 D01 limites do step error
GPS:SVPR:GPS:SAT ${PRN},ON,GOOD,0,0,0,100,3600
GPS:SVPR:GPS:SAT? ${PRN}
GPS:SVPR:GPS:SAT ${PRN},ON,GOOD,0,0,0,1000,3600
GPS:SVPR:GPS:SAT? ${PRN}
GPS:SVPR:GPS:SAT ${PRN},ON,GOOD,0,0,0,1000.5,3600
GPS:SVPR:GPS:SAT? ${PRN}
GPS:SVPR:GPS:SAT ${PRN},ON,GOOD,0,0,0,10000,3600
GPS:SVPR:GPS:SAT? ${PRN}

@mark E5 D18 reenvio do mesmo valor (com receptor de referencia, observar se o degrau dobra)
GPS:SVPR:GPS:SAT ${PRN},ON,GOOD,0,0,0,100,3600
@wait 5
GPS:SVPR:GPS:SAT ${PRN},ON,GOOD,0,0,0,100,3600
@wait 5
GPS:SVPR:GPS:SAT? ${PRN}

@mark E6 D02 Doppler, coerencia, offset de amplitude, duracao curta
GPS:SVPR:GPS:SAT ${PRN},ON,GOOD,50,0,0,0,10
GPS:SVPR:GPS:SAT? ${PRN}
@wait 12
GPS:SVPR:GPS:SAT? ${PRN}
GPS:SVPR:GPS:SAT ${PRN},ON,GOOD,0,0.5,0,0,3600
GPS:SVPR:GPS:SAT? ${PRN}
GPS:SVPR:GPS:SAT ${PRN},ON,GOOD,0,0,-6,0,3600
GPS:SVPR:GPS:SAT? ${PRN}
GPS:SVPR:GPS:SAT ${PRN},ON,BAD,0,0,0,0,3600
GPS:SVPR:GPS:SAT? ${PRN}
GPS:SVPR:GPS:SAT ${PRN},ON,GOOD,0,0,0,0,3600

@mark E7 D17 RF level durante execucao e parametro travado
GPS:SET:RFLV -125
GPS:SET:RFLV?
GPS:SET:RFLV -130
GPS:SET:CARR L2
GPS:SET:CARR?

@mark E8 verdade de referencia a 1 Hz
@poll 1 30 GPS:SIM:TIM? GPS:SIM:ETIM? GPS:SIM:LAT? GPS:SIM:LONG? GPS:SIM:ALT?
GPS:SVPR:GPS:LIST?
@stop

@mark E9 dinamico curto com a rota twin_probe (log de referencia do modo dinamico)
GPS:SET:STYP DYNAMIC
GPS:ROUT:LOAD "twin_probe.rte"
GPS:ROUT:FIL?
@run
@poll 1 120 GPS:SIM:TIM? GPS:SIM:LAT? GPS:SIM:LONG? GPS:SIM:ALT? GPS:SIM:SPD? GPS:SIM:HEAD? GPS:SIM:ARAT? GPS:SIM:FROM? GPS:SIM:TO? GPS:SIM:DTG?
@stop

# ---------------- G: golden files ----------------
@mark G1 exportacao
@pause Insira pendrive FAT32 dedicado. Exporta todos os arquivos de cada tipo, inclusive de outros usuarios: nao publicar.
GPS:FIL:SET:EXP
GPS:FIL:ROUT:EXP
GPS:FIL:ALM:EXP
GPS:FIL:NMEA:EXP
GPS:FIL:WAYP:EXP
GPS:STAT?

# ---------------- F: restauração ----------------
@mark F1 restauracao
GPS:FIL:SET:LOAD "twin_bkp_s01"
GPS:ROUT:LOAD "twin_bkp_s01.rte"
GPS:FIL:SET:FNAM?
GPS:ROUT:FIL?
GPS:STAT?
@mark F2 limpeza dos arquivos de sonda (apenas twin_tok e twin_probe; backups ficam ate confirmar)
GPS:FIL:SET:REM "twin_tok_1"
GPS:FIL:SET:REM "twin_tok_2"
GPS:FIL:SET:REM "twin_tok_3"
GPS:FIL:ROUT:REM "twin_probe.rte"
GPS:FIL:SET:FLST?
GPS:FIL:ROUT:FLST?
@mark S01 fim
